{
    "about": "This ruleset contains a collection of rules for Microsoft Entra. These rules perform static analysis on Entra ID artifacts and are used as a mechanism to evaluate the security configuration and best practices. Rules are also divided into categories and subcategories according to the rule's type. These rules are designed to determine whether security best practices are being adhered to. This will ensures that Microsoft Entra tenant will meet the industry standards.",
